          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Size a UPS by watts, not VA, and keep your normal load around half the rating. For any desktop computer with a modern power supply, buy pure sine: the CyberPower CP1500PFCLCD for most PCs, the APC BR1500MS2 if you want USB charging built in, or the CyberPower CP850PFCLCD for lighter office loads.
          </p>
